Releases are published only from that repository. If you obtained WardenOne from
anywhere else, or were directed to download it from another site, the build you
have was not produced here and its contents are unknown to this project. For a
security and privacy extension that distinction matters: verify before you
install it.

WardenOne asks for broad permissions in order to do its job, and every one of
them is documented in permissions.html. A build from an unverified source has
those same permissions and none of the accountability.


